* MODULO FILTRO — Fattibilita' core SVF OTA + converter esponenziale
* Requisiti: decisione 74 (2 sezioni full-range 10 Hz-35 kHz, ~3500:1),
*   questione 51 (converter expo + tempco, OTA reali, tolleranza ±5-10%),
*   decisione 67 (8 core mono, 6 CV condivise).
* Topologia [PROVVISORIO — regola 3]: SVF 2 poli = 2 integratori OTA
*   (macromodello gm = 19,2*Iabc come LM13700) non invertenti + summer
*   op-amp invertente; Q fisso 0,707 (controllo risonanza = design v0.2).
*   Iabc da differential pair BJT (2N3904: in v0.2 coppia matched monolitica),
*   coda 400 uA. DeltaV di comando = 212,5 - 57,7*vc mV (vc = CV 0-5 V):
*   vc=0 -> ~10 Hz, vc=5 -> ~35 kHz (estremi da verificare in misura).
* PTAT: ptat=1 scala DeltaV con T assoluta (compensazione V_T, tecnica
*   standard da synth: moltiplicatore PTAT reale in v0.2); ptat=0 = non
*   compensato (confronto deriva). temp = 0/27/50 C.
* C integratori 33 nF [PROVVISORIO]: gm 2,1 uS-7,3 mS -> Iabc 108 nA-380 uA.
* Limite del macromodello: OTA senza rail/limiti reali (G ideale); la
*   verifica del carattere sonoro va fatta col modello reale + prototipo.
*
.param vc=4.2466
.param ptat=1



*
* ---------- Alimentazioni ----------
Vcc vcc 0 DC 15
Vee vee 0 DC -15
*
* (DeltaV generato nel blocco converter, sorgente B flottante va->vb2)
*
* ---------- Converter esponenziale tempcompensato ----------
* Architettura classica da synth: Q1 diodo con I_ref, Q2 con Vbe2 = Vbe1 - DeltaV
* -> Ic2 = Ic1 * exp(-DeltaV/VT): rapporto puro, Is si cancella (coppia matched
* allo stesso T), NESSUN limite di coda (a differenza del diff pair single-ended,
* che comprime le ottave alte contro I_tail). Vce1 = Vce2 (collettori entrambi
* a V(va)) -> Early cancellato. DeltaV = 210,95 mV * (1 - vc/5), scalato PTAT.
* Range: Ic2 = 114 nA (vc=0, ~10,5 Hz) .. 397 uA (vc=5, ~37 kHz) = 3500:1.
* Modello 2N3904 standard (LTspice batch non carica la libreria componenti;
* in v0.2: coppia matched monolitica reale, es. classe MAT12/SSM2212/DMMT3904
* [reperibilita DA VERIFICARE, come per THAT 2181 — voce 37])
.model Q2N3904 NPN(Is=6.734f Rs=1.077 Vbf=74.08 Ise=1.068p Nr=2.009
+ Ikf=66.78m Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Cje=4.966p Vje=.75 Mje=.3556 Cjc=3.465p
+ Vjc=.75 Mjc=.3085 Xtb=1.5 Fc=.5 Tf=301.2p Tr=239.5n Br=.7306 Rb=1 Vaf=111.3)
Iref vcc va DC 400u
Q1 va va 0 Q2N3904
Bd va vb2 V={(0.21095-0.04219*vc)*if(ptat==1,(temp+273.15)/300.15,1)}
Vabc iabc va DC 0
Q2 iabc vb2 0 Q2N3904
*
* ---------- Summer op-amp (macro 1 polo, GBW ~1 GHz: ideale audio) ----------
.subckt OPAMP inp inn out vp vm
E1 x 0 value={1000*(V(inp)-V(inn))}
R1 x p1 1k
C1 p1 0 159p
E2 out 0 value={limit(V(p1),V(vm)+1.5,V(vp)-1.5)}
.ends OPAMP
*
* ---------- Ingresso ----------
V1 vin 0 DC 0 AC 1
*
* ---------- SVF 2 poli: summer + 2 integratori OTA ----------
* HP = -(VIN + LP + BP/Q), BP = +(w0/s)HP, LP = +(w0/s)BP  [D stabile]
Rvin vin ns 10k
Rlp lp ns 10k
Rbp bp ns 7.07k
Rf ns hp 10k
Xsum 0 ns hp vcc vee OPAMP
* Segno: LTspice definisce I(Vabc) uscente dal nodo +; il collettore NPN
* assorbe corrente -> I(Vabc) = -Ic -> gm = -19,2*I(Vabc) (positivo).
G1 0 bp value={-19.2*I(Vabc)*V(hp)}
C1i bp 0 33n
G2 0 lp value={-19.2*I(Vabc)*V(bp)}
C2i lp 0 33n
*
.op
.print op I(Vabc) Ic(Q1) Ic(Q2) Ib(Q2) V(va) V(vb2) V(iabc) V(hp) V(bp) V(lp)
.ac dec 1000 1 100k
* LP Butterworth (Q=0,707): |LP| = 0,707 esattamente a w0 -> fc robusta
.meas ac fc WHEN mag(V(lp))=0.707
* sanity: picco BP deve stare ~Q = 0,707 a ogni step
.meas ac bpk MAX mag(V(bp))
.meas ac lp1k FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 1k
.meas ac lp_at_fc FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 10806
.meas ac lp10 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 10
.meas ac lp100 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 100
.meas ac lp500 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 500
.meas ac lp1000 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 1000
.meas ac lp2000 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 2000
.meas ac lp4000 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 4000
.meas ac lp6000 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 6000
.meas ac lp7010 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 7010
.meas ac lp8000 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 8000
.meas ac lp9000 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 9000
.meas ac lp10806 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 10806
.meas ac lp12000 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 12000
.meas ac lp20000 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 20000
.meas ac lp50000 FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 50000
.meas ac bp10 FIND mag(V(bp)) AT 10
.meas ac bp100 FIND mag(V(bp)) AT 100
.meas ac bp500 FIND mag(V(bp)) AT 500
.meas ac bp1000 FIND mag(V(bp)) AT 1000
.meas ac bp2000 FIND mag(V(bp)) AT 2000
.meas ac bp4000 FIND mag(V(bp)) AT 4000
.meas ac bp6000 FIND mag(V(bp)) AT 6000
.meas ac bp7010 FIND mag(V(bp)) AT 7010
.end
.meas ac lp_at_fc FIND mag(V(lp)) AT 10806
